<title>SRI LANKA: Sampath up 5 pct on profit forecasts.</title>
<headline>Sampath up 5 pct on profit forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Sri Lanka's Sampath Bank Ltd rose 5.19 percent or 3.50 rupees to 71, in early Thursday trade, as the bank is seen performing well in 1997, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The bank is forecast to see profits grow by over 25 percent from a 1996 bottom line figure of 282 million rupees,&quot; said a broker who declined to be identified.</p>
<p>Sampath Bank, one of four private listed commercial banks, saw net profit grow by 25 percent to 75.2 million rupees, in the first quarter of 1997.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
